# Project-K (KZYS) — Project Memory

Open-source Zoom/Teams-style video conferencing on **LiveKit SFU**. Current phase: **"Join Never Fails"** — reliable joins, TURN, mobile/LAN testing, stable UI. Next target: **GKE load-test deploy** (not yet applied to cloud).

## User intent (carry forward)

- Prefer **fresh sessions** (not resume) — this rule is the continuity layer.
- **docker-compose.yaml** = local dev only; do not widen its UDP port ranges.
- **K8s + media Dockerfiles** = GKE / load-test port ranges.
- **Build-time vs runtime env** must stay separated (see below).
- Only commit when explicitly asked.

## Stack (pinned)

| Component | Version |
|-----------|---------|
| LiveKit server | v1.9.12 |
| livekit-client | 2.20.1 |
| @livekit/components-react | 2.9.23 |
| Go control plane | `server/` |
| Web | Vite + React `web/` |

## Architecture

```
Browser → Gateway (GKE L7): web /api /ws /livekit
        → NLB (GKE L4): LiveKit UDP 50000-59000, Coturn relay 20000-29000
Control plane (Go) → Redis, LiveKit tokens, chat WebSocket
Chat uses Go WS — NOT LiveKit data channels
```

## Local dev (docker-compose — unchanged)

- Desktop: `https://localhost:5173` or `https://<LAN_IP>:5173`
- Mobile same Wi‑Fi: `https://<LAN_IP>:5173` (accept self-signed cert)
- **Do NOT use** `http://<LAN_IP>:5173` (Vite dev is HTTPS-only)
- LiveKit local UDP: **51000–51030** | Coturn relay: **20000–20200**
- `.env`: `PUBLIC_HOST`, `CORS_ORIGIN=*`, JWT/TURN/LiveKit secrets

## GKE (k8s — load-test ranges)

- Apply: `kubectl apply -k k8s/overlays/gke` (+ `k8s/secrets.yaml` separately)
- Layout: `k8s/base/` (microservices + Gateway) + `k8s/overlays/gke/` (NLB UDP)
- LiveKit WebRTC UDP: **50000–59000** | Coturn relay: **20000–29000**
- Regenerate port YAML: `powershell -File k8s/scripts/generate-media-ports.ps1`
- Open GCP firewall for both UDP ranges after deploy
- Set `MEDIA_NODE_IP` + `TURN_HOST` in `k8s/base/config/app-configmap.yaml` after NLB IPs appear

## Build-time vs runtime env

| Where | What |
|-------|------|
| **CI web build** | `VITE_API_URL=` empty → same-origin via Gateway |
| **CI never bakes** | LiveKit URL, TURN, JWT, secrets |
| **K8s runtime** | `k8s/secrets.yaml` + `k8s/base/config/app-configmap.yaml` |
| **Join ticket** | Server sets `livekitUrl` at runtime from `LIVEKIT_URL` |

Images: `kyawzayarsoe/project-k-{server,web,livekit,coturn}` via `.github/workflows/docker-build.yml`

