## Resolved / known (do not re-debug unless broken)

- `DATA_TRACK_LOSSY closed unexpectedly` → **low priority**; unused LiveKit data-track channel; video/audio/chat unaffected
- "Low bandwidth audio-only" on LAN → often false positive during ICE setup
- React remount join issues → fixed via `livekitSession.ts` singleton + `RoomContext.Provider`
- Mobile join → HTTPS + Vite proxy + `resolveUrls.ts` loopback rewrite

